# UI / Angular conventions

- Standalone components + lazy routes; reuse `app-icon`, `assetUrl`, existing card/page patterns.
- Theme tokens live in `src/styles.css` (`ink`, `accent`, `pine`, `mist`, `paper`, etc.). Keep alpine/pine look; avoid purple-default AI aesthetics.
- Blog body styling: `.prose-blog` in `src/styles.css` — improve carefully for messy Blogger HTML.
- Post cards: keep compact sizing; always show media area (cover or placeholder).
- Experience company names link via `companyUrl` when present.
- Contact CTAs come from `site.social` / `site.email` (LinkedIn primary, plus email/GitHub/Instagram).
